            "name": "pr_caveat",
            "textbox_spec": "### Why there is no PR time-to-merge here\nPull request payloads no longer carry timestamps, so a merge can only be timed when its `opened` event is in the data too. Because the feed is sampled, that is true for under 2% of merges, on every day of the week. Issue payloads still carry their own timestamps, so time-to-close is reliable."
